{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesTorusLink","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Rank","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Projection"],"declarations":139,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.markov_gam_pow_explicit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.markov_gam_pow_explicit","kind":"theorem","line":1638,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1638-L1653","doc":"The same for every Markov trace with `z_D`, on any Hecke family. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_gam_pow_explicit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_gam_pow_explicit","kind":"theorem","line":1625,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1625-L1636","doc":"**Rosso–Jones per standard module, for every torus link `T(r, p)`**:\n`tr(W γ^p) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · tr(γ^p | W_{r,j})`, with `tr(γ^p | W_{r,j})`\ngiven by `trace_gamW`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_gamW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_gamW","kind":"theorem","line":1603,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1603-L1623","doc":"**`tr(γ^p | W_{r,j})` for every `p`** (`2j ≤ r`): `q^{np}` on `W_{r,0}`, and\n`T_j(ρ^p) − T_{j−1}(ρ'^p)` on `W_{r,j}`, `j ≥ 1`, with the periodic-state closed forms `rhoTr`,\n`rho'Tr` of `RossoJonesTorusLink`. No coprimality. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.markov_fullTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.markov_fullTwist","kind":"theorem","line":1582,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1582-L1599","doc":"**The same for every Markov trace with `z_D`**: on any Hecke family, `n ≤ N`,\n`(q² + 1)^r t(Δ^{2t}) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · s_j^t · dim W_{r,j}`,\n`Δ² = (s₀ ⋯ s_{n−1})^{n+1}` the full twist. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_fullTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_fullTwist","kind":"theorem","line":1569,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1569-L1580","doc":"**Rosso–Jones per standard module, for the full twists `γ^{rt}`.**\n`tr(W γ^{rt}) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · (q^{r(r−1)−2j(r−j+1)})^t · dim W_{r,j}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.finrank_Wmod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.finrank_Wmod","kind":"theorem","line":1549,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1549-L1567","doc":"**The dimension of the standard module**: `dim W_{r,j} = C(r, j) − C(r, j − 1)` for\n`2j ≤ r` (`C(r, −1) = 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.choose_eq_sum_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.choose_eq_sum_dim","kind":"theorem","line":1535,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1535-L1547","doc":"`C(r, m) = Σ_{j ≤ min(m, r−m)} dim W_{r,j}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trK_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trK_one","kind":"theorem","line":1523,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1523-L1533","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_one","kind":"theorem","line":1518,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1518-L1521","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gamW_fullTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gamW_fullTwist","kind":"theorem","line":1498,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1498-L1514","doc":"**The full twist on the standard module `W_{r,j}`** (`2j ≤ r`): `γ^{rt}` acts on `W_{r,j}`\nas the scalar `(q^{r(r−1) − 2j(r−j+1)})^t` (`twistScalar`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_inj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_inj","kind":"theorem","line":1493,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1493-L1496","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_smul","kind":"theorem","line":1490,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1490-L1491","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_Xl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_Xl","kind":"theorem","line":1476,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1476-L1488","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.fullTwist_pow_mulVec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.fullTwist_pow_mulVec","kind":"theorem","line":1466,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1466-L1474","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.fullTwist_mulVec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.fullTwist_mulVec","kind":"theorem","line":1412,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1412-L1464","doc":"**The full twist on highest-weight vectors.** If `w` has weight `r − j` (`2j ≤ r`) and\n`E w = 0`, then `γ^r w = twistScalar · w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_comm","kind":"theorem","line":1405,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1405-L1410","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_Em","kind":"theorem","line":1401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1401-L1403","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_smul","kind":"theorem","line":1397,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1397-L1399","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_add","kind":"theorem","line":1393,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1393-L1395","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_zero_vec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_zero_vec","kind":"theorem","line":1387,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1387-L1391","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_smul","kind":"theorem","line":1381,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1381-L1385","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_add","kind":"theorem","line":1375,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1375-L1379","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_WP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_WP","kind":"theorem","line":1366,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1366-L1373","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_zero_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_zero_Em","kind":"theorem","line":1354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1354-L1364","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_Em","kind":"theorem","line":1341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1341-L1352","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_prj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_prj","kind":"theorem","line":1338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1338-L1339","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_of_supp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj_of_supp","kind":"theorem","line":1333,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1333-L1336","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prj","kind":"def","line":1329,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1329-L1331","doc":"Projection onto weight `m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.rho_pow_mulVec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.rho_pow_mulVec","kind":"theorem","line":1310,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1310-L1327","doc":"**`ρ^r` is the scalar `twistScalar` on `V_j`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.rot_iterate_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.rot_iterate_self","kind":"theorem","line":1307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1307-L1308","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.twistScalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.twistScalar","kind":"def","line":1302,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1302-L1305","doc":"The scalar of the full twist on `W_{r,j}`: `q^{(r−1−j)(r−j)} (q^{j−1} q^{−2})^j`,\ni.e. `q^{r(r−1) − 2j(r−j+1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_gam_pow_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_W_gam_pow_split","kind":"theorem","line":1285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1285-L1298","doc":"**The quantum trace of `γ^p` over the standard modules**:\n`tr(W γ^p) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · tr(γ^p | W_{r,j})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.T_gam_pow_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.T_gam_pow_split","kind":"theorem","line":1276,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1276-L1283","doc":"**Schur–Weyl for the torus braid.** Each weight-space trace of `γ^p` is the sum of the\ntraces of `γ^p` on the standard modules `W_{r,j}` with `j ≤ min(m, r − m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gamW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gamW","kind":"def","line":1270,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1270-L1274","doc":"**`γ^p` on the standard module `W_{r,j}`** (`r = n + 1`): the restriction of the weight-\n`(r − j)` block of `γ^p` to `ker E`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gam_pow_comm_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gam_pow_comm_Em","kind":"theorem","line":1266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1266-L1268","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gam_comm_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.gam_comm_Em","kind":"theorem","line":1258,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1258-L1264","doc":"**`γ` commutes with `E`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_gam","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_gam","kind":"theorem","line":1237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1237-L1256","doc":"**`γ` preserves the weight.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_pow","kind":"theorem","line":1232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1232-L1235","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_one","kind":"theorem","line":1225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1225-L1230","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP_mul","kind":"theorem","line":1218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1218-L1223","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_cons'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_cons'","kind":"theorem","line":1212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1212-L1216","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.T_eq_trace_blk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.T_eq_trace_blk","kind":"theorem","line":1203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1203-L1208","doc":"The weight-space trace of `RossoJonesGeneral` is the trace of the block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_split","kind":"theorem","line":1188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1188-L1201","doc":"**The Schur–Weyl trace split** (`r = n + 1`, `[k]_q ≠ 0` for `1 ≤ k ≤ r`). For every\nweight-preserving `X` commuting with `E`,\n`tr(X | V_m) = Σ_{j ≤ min(m, r − m)} tr(X | W_{r,j})`, `W_{r,j} = ker E ∩ V_{r−j}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_lower","kind":"theorem","line":1168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1168-L1186","doc":"**The lower half is isomorphic to the upper half**: `T_m(X) = T_{r−m}(X)` for `2m < r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_bij","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_bij","kind":"theorem","line":1158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1158-L1166","doc":"`E^{r−2m} : V_m → V_{r−m}` is bijective for `2m ≤ r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.card_St","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.card_St","kind":"theorem","line":1154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1154-L1156","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_inj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_inj","kind":"theorem","line":1143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1143-L1152","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_Ec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_Ec","kind":"theorem","line":1135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1135-L1141","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_El","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_El","kind":"theorem","line":1121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1121-L1133","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":1115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1115-L1119","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_ext0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_ext0","kind":"theorem","line":1112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1112-L1113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ext0","kind":"def","line":1108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1108-L1110","doc":"Extension by zero of a weight-`m` vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_inj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_inj","kind":"theorem","line":1055,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1055-L1106","doc":"**`E^k` is injective on `V_m` when `2m + k ≤ r`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_Fm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_Fm","kind":"theorem","line":1039,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1039-L1053","doc":"`E^{j+1} F v = F E^{j+1} v + (Σ_{i ≤ j} [2(m+i) − r]) E^j v` for `v` of weight `m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Dg_mulVec'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Dg_mulVec'","kind":"theorem","line":1030,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1030-L1037","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_Epow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.supp_Epow","kind":"theorem","line":1025,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1025-L1028","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow_succ","kind":"theorem","line":1022,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1022-L1023","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Epow","kind":"def","line":1017,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1017-L1020","doc":"`E^k` on vectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_comp_Xl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec_comp_Xl","kind":"theorem","line":1008,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1008-L1015","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Ec","kind":"def","line":1003,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L1003-L1006","doc":"`E^k` from weight `m` to weight `m + k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_inj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_inj","kind":"theorem","line":977,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L977-L1001","doc":"`E` is injective from weight `m` when `2m < r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_upper","kind":"theorem","line":955,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L955-L975","doc":"**The split on the upper half.** For `s ≤ r` with `r ≤ 2(r − s) + 1`,\n`T_{r−s}(X) = Σ_{j ≤ s} tr(X | ker E at weight r − j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_blk_empty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_blk_empty","kind":"theorem","line":951,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L951-L953","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_step","kind":"theorem","line":938,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L938-L947","doc":"**One step of the split**: on the upper half, the weight-`m` trace is the trace on the\nkernel of `E` plus the weight-`(m+1)` trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_surj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_surj","kind":"theorem","line":878,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L878-L936","doc":"**`E` is surjective on the upper half**: from weight `m` onto weight `m + 1` when\n`r ≤ 2m + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_le'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_le'","kind":"theorem","line":876,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L876-L876","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trK","kind":"def","line":871,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L871-L874","doc":"The trace of `X` on the kernel of `E` at weight `m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Wmod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Wmod","kind":"def","line":866,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L866-L869","doc":"**The standard module** `W_{r,j}`, `r = n + 1`: the vectors of weight `r − j` killed by\n`E` (the highest-weight vectors of the summand `L_{r−2j}` of `V^{⊗r}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ker_El_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ker_El_inv","kind":"theorem","line":859,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L859-L864","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_comp_Xl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El_comp_Xl","kind":"theorem","line":853,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L853-L857","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.El","kind":"def","line":849,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L849-L851","doc":"`E` from weight `m` to weight `m + 1`, as a linear map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Xl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Xl","kind":"def","line":845,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L845-L847","doc":"The weight-`m` block of `X`, as a linear map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_mul","kind":"theorem","line":835,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L835-L843","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_mul_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_mul_Em","kind":"theorem","line":825,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L825-L833","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_Em_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk_Em_mul","kind":"theorem","line":815,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L815-L823","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_over_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_over_weight","kind":"theorem","line":808,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L808-L813","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.WP","kind":"def","line":804,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L804-L806","doc":"`M` preserves the weight (the number of ones). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.blk","kind":"def","line":800,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L800-L802","doc":"The block of `M` from weight `m` to weight `m'`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.St","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.St","kind":"def","line":797,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L797-L798","doc":"The weight-`m` states of `V^{⊗(n+1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Em_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Em_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":750,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L750-L793","doc":"**`Eᵀ` at `q` is `E` at `q⁻¹` on complemented states.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN_inv_cmp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN_inv_cmp","kind":"theorem","line":744,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L744-L748","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ki_inv_fl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ki_inv_fl","kind":"theorem","line":741,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L741-L742","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_cmp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.ones_cmp","kind":"theorem","line":734,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/