ation","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.weight_swap","kind":"theorem","line":398,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L398-L422","doc":"The off-diagonal weights of `EF` and `FE` agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN_update_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN_update_self","kind":"theorem","line":393,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L393-L396","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.psi_update_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.psi_update_self","kind":"theorem","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L388-L391","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prod_cond_update","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.prod_cond_update","kind":"theorem","line":372,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L372-L386","doc":"A conditional product changes at one site only. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.mul_Fm_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.mul_Fm_apply","kind":"theorem","line":359,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L359-L370","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Dg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Dg","kind":"def","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L355-L357","doc":"The diagonal of `[E, F]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Fm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.Fm","kind":"def","line":349,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L349-L353","doc":"**The lowering operator** `F = Σ_k K⁻¹ ⊗ ⋯ ⊗ K⁻¹ ⊗ f_k` of `U_q(sl₂)` on `V^{⊗(n+1)}`,\n`f : 1 ↦ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phi_eq_phiN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phi_eq_phiN","kind":"theorem","line":346,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L346-L347","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.phiN","kind":"def","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L342-L344","doc":"The `K`-string to the right of site `k` (the `phi` of `RossoJonesMiddle`, any length). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.psi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.psi","kind":"def","line":338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L338-L340","doc":"The `K⁻¹`-string to the left of site `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.kin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.kin","kind":"def","line":335,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L335-L336","doc":"`K⁻¹` on one site: `q` on a zero, `q⁻¹` on a one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_qZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_qZ","kind":"theorem","line":318,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L318-L327","doc":"`Σ_{i<k} [a + 2i] = [k][a + k − 1]` for `a ∈ ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_mul","kind":"theorem","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L285-L316","doc":"`[k+1][b+1] = [k][b] + [b+k+1]` for every `b ∈ ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sq_eq_qZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sq_eq_qZ","kind":"theorem","line":279,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L279-L283","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_succ","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L266-L277","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_neg_nat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qZ_neg_nat","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://