antum integer `[o − z]`, written with two naturals. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_qn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.sum_qn","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L181-L191","doc":"`Σ_{i<j} [D + 2i] = [j][D + j − 1]` for `D ≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_mul","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L167-L179","doc":"`[a+1][b+1] = [a][b] + [a+b+1]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_inv","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L161-L165","doc":"`[k]` is invariant under `q ↦ q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_succ'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_succ'","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L150-L159","doc":"The other recursion, `[k+1] = q[k] + q^{−k}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_one","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L148-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_succ","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L146-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn_zero","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L144-L144","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.qn","kind":"def","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L139-L142","doc":"The quantum integer `[k] = q^{k−1} + q^{k−3} + ⋯ + q^{1−k}`, by `[k+1] = q^k + q⁻¹[k]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_eq_trace_ker_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace.trace_eq_trace_ker_add","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SchurWeylTrace.lean#L76-L133","signatureChunk":0}]}